#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:0
msgid ""
"Learn how to install snap on Linux Mint by disabling the nosnap preference, "
"installing it through Software Manager or APT, and testing it with hello-"
"world."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:8
msgid "Install snap on Linux Mint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:10
msgid ""
"Snap is available for the latest release of Linux Mint, 22.1 (Xia), and for "
"older releases from Linux Mint 18.2 (Sonya) onwards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:12
msgid ""
"You can find out which version of Linux Mint you're running by opening "
"*System info* from the *Preferences* menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:14
msgid ""
"From Linux Mint 20 onwards, installing Snap is blocked by a file called "
"`nosnap.pref` in the directory `/etc/apt/preferences.d/`; this file needs to "
"be either moved or removed from the directory, or renamed with an extension "
"other than `.pref` before Snap can be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:16
msgid ""
"This can be accomplished from the command line, and the following command "
"(for example) renames `nosnap.pref` to `nosnap.bak`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:18
msgid ""
"sudo mv /etc/apt/preferences.d/nosnap.pref /etc/apt/preferences.d/"
"nosnap.bak\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:22
msgid "With the file renamed, the package database needs to be updated next:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:24
msgid "sudo apt update\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:28
msgid ""
"To now install snap from the Software Manager application, search for "
"*snapd* and click **Install**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:30
msgid "Alternatively, *snapd* can be installed from the command line:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:32
msgid "sudo apt install snapd\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:36
msgid ""
"To complete the installation, either restart your machine, or log out and in "
"again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:38
msgid ""
"To test your system, install the [hello-world](https://snapcraft.io/hello-"
"world) snap and make sure it runs correctly:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:40
msgid ""
"$ snap install hello-world\n"
"hello-world 6.4 from Canonical✓ installed\n"
"$ hello-world\n"
"Hello World!\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/install-the-daemon/linux-mint.md:47
msgid "Snap is now installed and ready to go!"
msgstr ""
